---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
import HeroSection from "../components/landing/HeroSection.astro"
import InstallPill from "../components/InstallPill.astro"

const capabilities = [
  ["Requests", "URL, params, headers, body, and auth"],
  ["Responses", "Body, headers, cookies, status, and timing"],
  ["Collections", "Folders, inherited context, and Git-friendly files"],
  ["Environments", "Switchable variables and secure values"],
  ["Transport", "Proxy, TLS, mTLS, and authentication"],
  ["Portability", "OpenAPI, Swagger, Postman, and Insomnia"],
]

const nextItems = [
  ["Assertions and captures", "Validate responses and pass captured values into later requests."],
  ["Scripts and advanced tests", "Add reusable setup, teardown, and deeper request checks."],
  ["Richer CI reporting", "Expand collection runs with reports such as JUnit."],
]
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Noodle · API workflows in your terminal"
  description="Write, send, inspect, and automate HTTP requests from version-controlled YAML files."
>
  <HeroSection />

  <main class="landing">
    <section class="feature-list" aria-label="Noodle features">
      <article class="feature-row">
        <div class="feature-copy">
          <h2>Requests that belong in the repository.</h2>
          <p>Every request is a readable YAML file. Edit it in Noodle or your editor, review it in Git, and keep it beside the code it exercises.</p>
          <a href="/docs/reference/collection-format/">Request file reference</a>
        </div>

        <div class="code-proof" aria-label="Example request file">
          <div class="proof-bar"><span>collections/users/get.yml</span><span>tracked</span></div>
          <pre><code><span class="syntax-violet">name:</span> Get user
<span class="syntax-violet">method:</span> <span class="syntax-orange">GET</span>
<span class="syntax-violet">url:</span> <span class="syntax-cyan">"$base_url/users/:id"</span>
<span class="syntax-violet">headers:</span>
  Accept: <span class="syntax-cyan">application/json</span>
<span class="syntax-violet">params:</span>
  id: <span class="syntax-green">42</span></code></pre>
          <div class="proof-foot"><span>● valid request</span><span>plain YAML on disk</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-row feature-row--reverse">
        <div class="exchange-proof" aria-label="Request and response inspection flow">
          <div class="exchange-step">
            <span>Request</span>
            <strong><i>PUT</i> /users/42</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="exchange-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="exchange-step">
            <span>Response</span>
            <strong class="syntax-green">200 OK</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="response-facts">
            <div><span>Body</span><code>application/json</code></div>
            <div><span>Headers</span><code>12 received</code></div>
            <div><span>Timeline</span><code>87ms total</code></div>
            <div><span>Cookies</span><code>jar active</code></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-copy">
          <h2>The whole exchange, without leaving the terminal.</h2>
          <p>Compose a request, send it, then move through body, headers, cookies, and timing from the same keyboard-first workspace.</p>
          <a href="/docs/guides/using-the-response-pane/">Inspecting responses</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-row">
        <div class="feature-copy">
          <h2>Environment-aware without leaking secrets.</h2>
          <p>Switch between development, staging, and production variables. Secret declarations stay in the file while values live in the OS credential vault or process environment.</p>
          <a href="/docs/guides/using-environments/">Using environments</a>
        </div>

        <div class="environment-proof" aria-label="Environment and secret state">
          <div class="environment-head"><span>Environment</span><span>State</span></div>
          <div><strong><i class="dot dot-green"></i>development</strong><span>active</span></div>
          <div><strong><i class="dot dot-orange"></i>staging</strong><span>ready</span></div>
          <div><strong><i class="dot dot-violet"></i>production</strong><span>ready</span></div>
          <div class="secret-row"><code>API_TOKEN</code><span>OS credential vault</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-row feature-row--reverse">
        <div class="terminal-proof" aria-label="Noodle CLI and agent commands">
          <div><span>$</span><code>noodle request run users/get --collection ./api</code></div>
          <div><span>$</span><code>noodle collection audit ./api</code></div>
          <div><span>$</span><code>noodle collection run ./api --env staging --json</code></div>
          <div><span>$</span><code>noodle agent install</code></div>
          <p><span>status</span> success · exit 0 · JSON available</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-copy">
          <h2>One collection, more than one way to work.</h2>
          <p>Explore interactively in the TUI, run requests from the CLI, automate collection checks, or give coding agents the supported Noodle skill.</p>
          <a href="/docs/getting-started/cli/">CLI and automation</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="capability-section" aria-labelledby="capability-title">
      <header>
        <h2 id="capability-title">The rest of the workflow is already here.</h2>
        <p>Focused enough to stay fast, complete enough to handle real API work.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="capability-grid">
        {capabilities.map(([title, body]) => (
          <article>
            <h3>{title}</h3>
            <p>{body}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="portability-line">
        <span>Import</span><code>OpenAPI · Swagger · Postman · Insomnia</code>
        <span>Export</span><code>OpenAPI · Postman</code>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="coming-next" aria-labelledby="next-title">
      <header>
        <h2 id="next-title">Coming next</h2>
        <p>Planned directions, clearly separated from what Noodle ships today.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="next-grid">
        {nextItems.map(([title, body]) => (
          <article>
            <span>Coming next</span>
            <h3>{title}</h3>
            <p>{body}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="closing" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
      <h2 id="closing-title">Put your API workflow where it belongs.</h2>
      <p>Install Noodle and open your first collection.</p>
      <InstallPill id="closing-install" command="curl -LsSf https://noodlerest.dev/install.sh | sh" />
      <a href="/docs/getting-started/quick-start/">Follow the quick start</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .landing {
    width: min(100%, 1200px);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 1.5rem;
  }

  .feature-list {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .feature-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(16rem, 0.72fr) minmax(0, 1.28fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 310px;
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .feature-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .feature-row--reverse {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.28fr) minmax(16rem, 0.72fr);
  }

  .feature-copy {
    max-width: 30rem;
  }

  .feature-copy h2,
  .capability-section h2,
  .coming-next h2,
  .closing h2 {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .feature-copy p,
  .capability-section header p,
  .coming-next header p,
  .closing > p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .feature-copy a,
  .closing > a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--violet);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-underline-offset: 0.3em;
  }

  .code-proof,
  .exchange-proof,
  .environment-proof,
  .terminal-proof {
    min-width: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .proof-bar,
  .proof-foot {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .proof-foot {
    color: var(--green);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .proof-foot span:last-child {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .code-proof pre {
    min-height: 220px;
    margin: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding: 1.6rem;
    background: transparent;
  }

  .code-proof code {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .syntax-violet { color: var(--violet); }
  .syntax-orange { color: var(--orange); }
  .syntax-cyan { color: var(--cyan); }
  .syntax-green { color: var(--green); }

  .exchange-proof {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 4rem 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .exchange-step {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .exchange-step span {
    color: var(--violet);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .exchange-step strong {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .exchange-step i {
    color: var(--orange);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .exchange-line {
    height: 1px;
    margin-inline: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--violet);
  }

  .response-facts {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin: 1.5rem -1.5rem -1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .response-facts div {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .response-facts div:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  .response-facts span {
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .response-facts code {
    overflow-x: auto;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-size: inherit;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .environment-proof > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 54px;
    padding-inline: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .environment-proof > div:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .environment-head {
    min-height: 38px !important;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .environment-proof strong {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .environment-proof > div > span:last-child {
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    margin-right: 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .dot-green { background: var(--green); }
  .dot-orange { background: var(--orange); }
  .dot-violet { background: var(--violet); }

  .environment-proof .secret-row {
    min-height: 70px;
  }

  .secret-row code {
    color: var(--violet);
  }

  .secret-row span:last-child {
    color: var(--fg) !important;
  }

  .terminal-proof > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 52px;
    padding-inline: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .terminal-proof > div > span {
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .terminal-proof code {
    min-width: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-size: inherit;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .terminal-proof p {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .terminal-proof p span {
    color: var(--violet);
  }

  .capability-section {
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .capability-section header,
  .coming-next header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(18rem, 0.7fr);
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .capability-section header h2,
  .coming-next header h2 {
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .capability-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .capability-grid article {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .capability-grid article:nth-child(3n) {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  .capability-grid article:nth-last-child(-n + 3) {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .capability-grid h3,
  .next-grid h3 {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .capability-grid p,
  .next-grid p {
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .portability-line {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 0.55fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 60px;
    padding-inline: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .portability-line span {
    color: var(--violet);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .portability-line code {
    overflow-x: auto;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-size: inherit;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .coming-next {
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .next-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .next-grid article {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .next-grid article:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  .next-grid article > span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--violet);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .closing {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    padding: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7rem) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .closing h2 {
    max-width: 22ch;
  }

  .closing :global(.install-block) {
    width: min(100%, 34rem);
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .feature-row,
    .feature-row--reverse {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .feature-row--reverse .exchange-proof,
    .feature-row--reverse .terminal-proof {
      order: 2;
    }

    .feature-copy {
      max-width: 42rem;
    }

    .capability-section header,
    .coming-next header {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .landing {
      padding-inline: 1rem;
    }

    .response-facts,
    .capability-grid,
    .next-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .response-facts div,
    .capability-grid article,
    .capability-grid article:nth-child(3n),
    .capability-grid article:nth-last-child(-n + 3),
    .next-grid article {
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    .response-facts div:last-child,
    .capability-grid article:last-child,
    .next-grid article:last-child {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .portability-line {
      grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
      padding-block: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
